{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415805","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415805","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041580501:0":{"text":"Aurora, wake up.","source_cn":"奥萝菈，醒醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B9DCAABCBBD5CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580502:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580503:1":{"text":"... Aurora, wake up!","source_cn":"……奥萝菈，醒醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27490BB363B679BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580504:1":{"text":"Mhmm... Marene? What is it?","source_cn":"唔……是卓琳啊……有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E6616BE03A88FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580505:1":{"text":"I need your help.","source_cn":"有件事需要你帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x941625CC05510C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580506:1":{"text":"A sudden storm hit the sea, and two fishing boats are trapped. Flying there will take me too long, it won't compare to your dream teleportation.","source_cn":"海上突然出现暴风雨，有两艘渔船被困在里面。我赶过去需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BBAA692426F08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580507:1":{"text":"But... I can't send you through dreams... I can only go myself...","source_cn":"可是，我没办法通过梦境将你传送过去……我只能自己前往那里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD440DB27C428E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580508:1":{"text":"Then you can take some lifesaving supplies for me and keep those fishermen alive.","source_cn":"你可以替我运一些救生用品过去，帮渔民们保命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA132D484117045D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580509:1":{"text":"Alright...","source_cn":"没问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3666396984AA96DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580510:1":{"text":"I'll need the location of the boats, and the nearest village too.","source_cn":"我需要渔船的位置，还有临近村庄的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13791AA1D5EFBB33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580511:1":{"text":"The nearest village? Why do you need that? We're running out of time!","source_cn":"临近村庄的位置？要这做什么？时间很紧迫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F37752785DD6504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580512:1":{"text":"With a storm coming, the people on those boats probably won't be able to sleep... Without a dream, I can't reach them.","source_cn":"暴风雨来临，渔船上的人应该很难安眠才对……没有梦境，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD26EFCC43DA60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580513:1":{"text":"Just in case, I'll have to travel through the dreams of people nearby.","source_cn":"以防万一，我只能从临近的人们的梦境里前往。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC60B4DFA9D43F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580514:1":{"text":"Oh, and I'll need a list of the supplies to transport. If that's all right...","source_cn":"对了，我还需要运输物品的清单。如果方便的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6B2B68105E524A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580515:1":{"text":"Tsk... We don't have time for this!","source_cn":"啧……没有那么多时间了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CACBF42734FDC4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580516:1":{"text":"I need to get there as fast as I can! We'll worry about dream travel another time!","source_cn":"我得尽快赶过去！梦境传送的事下次再说吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFDA9A5AA6286851","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041580517:1":{"text":"Huh? Wait, Marene—","source_cn":"咦？卓、卓琳——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83EE4C02F8EE9508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041580518:1":{"text":"Hmm... Compared to Marene, am I just a little too slow-paced...?","source_cn":"嗯……和卓琳比起来，我的性格是不是有点慢过头了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8759D745BCC10B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卓琳":{"text":"Marene","source":"卓琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"Aurora","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}